      "content": "ASHLEY GREEN           HOG LANE SP 90 NE 1/10 22.12.58                                             Barn to North-East of                                                      Old Oak Farmhouse GV                                                       II Early C18 timber-framed and weatherboarded barn of 6 bays in 2 builds, each of 3 bays.  Old tile roofs, brick plinth.  Three north bays earlier.  Centre entry. Raking, queen-post roof trusses.  Curved purlin, wall plate, and tie beam braces. Slated lean to north gable elevation.  Three south bays, with raking queen-post trusses and straight braces to tie beams.  Centre rail.  Left hand entry.  Brick south wall. Listing NGR: SP9737905441"
    }
